{"partie":"beta3","galaxie":"galaxie2","forum":4,"topic":4458,"titre":"[CdC] Enchère de CLA","forum_nom":"Marché galactique : discussions commerciales","pages":2,"messages":{"1":[{"auteur":"Tassad","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/682.jpg","date_sans_annee":"02/07 20:11","score":0,"id":111866,"texte":"Bonjour a tous.\n\nLe consortium de Chrisos et heureux de vous annoncer la mise aux enchères de 2 millions de CLA tout neuf.\n\nLes enchères commencent a 600 milliards.\nInterdit d'enchérir de moins de 10 milliards\nFin des enchères....disons..euh...mardi soir (hrp: et si j'ai une mention au bac je vous fait une reduction de 50 milliard.)\n\nQUE LES ENCHERES COMMENCENT"},{"auteur":"général locius","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1492.jpg","date_sans_annee":"02/07 20:13","score":0,"id":111868,"texte":"600 milliards"},{"auteur":"herdac","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1750.jpg","date_sans_annee":"02/07 20:33","score":0,"id":111906,"texte":"610ma"},{"auteur":"général locius","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1492.jpg","date_sans_annee":"02/07 20:33","score":0,"id":111908,"texte":"620 ma"},{"auteur":"anubis le mage","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1448.jpg","date_sans_annee":"02/07 20:39","score":0,"id":111917,"texte":"700ma"},{"auteur":"général locius","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1492.jpg","date_sans_annee":"02/07 20:39","score":0,"id":111919,"texte":"750 ma"},{"auteur":"Absolute Sith","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1851.jpg","date_sans_annee":"02/07 21:02","score":0,"id":111955,"texte":"800"},{"auteur":"général locius","avatar":"archivesbeta.apocalypsis.org/beta3/galaxie_2/forums_galactiques/avatars/1492.jpg","date_sans_annee